codex
I found the specific environment fault: processes report a PID that is absent from this sandbox’s `/proc`, while `/proc/self/exe` remains resolvable. Lean’s application-path discovery fails at that boundary. I’m validating a narrowly scoped compatibility shim that only redirects `/proc/<reported-pid>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`; if it works, I can still run the exact pinned Lean/Lake binaries and will disclose the shim in the evidence.
apply patch
