+| Frozen lines | Rule family | Independent class |
+|---|---|---|
+| 9 | `onlyStrings` empty case | `DEFINITION` |
+| 10–11 | `onlyStrings` recurrence | `DEFINITION` |
+| 16 | `stringCodes` string projection | `DEFINITION` |
