+```lean
+∀ (V : SortVal)
+  (h : («isStrV(_)_MPY-BUILTINS_Bool_Val» V) = true),
+  («seqLen(_)_MPY-BUILTINS_Int_Val» V : SortInt) =
+    («isLen(_)_MPY-CORE_Int_IntSeq»
+      («stringCodes(_)_VERIFICATION_IntSeq_Val» V) : SortInt)
